cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, its evidence ledgers or its protocols, please cite
  them as below. The article they support is in preparation.
title: >-
  Verifiable compliance evidence for high-risk AI under the EU AI Act:
  code, evidence ledgers and experiment protocols
type: software
version: article-v1.0
license: MIT
